# LaTeX Report Build (Dissertation)

The M.Tech dissertation report lives at
`college/mydeliverables/1st-Review/report/main.tex` — a single-file
`report`-class document (title page, certificate, declaration, 7 chapters,
manual `thebibliography`). No `\input`/`\include` split; edit `main.tex`
directly.

## Problem

The LaTeX toolchain is **not on PATH**. Running `latexmk`, `pdflatex`,
`xelatex`, etc. from a normal shell returns "command not found", so a naive
`latexmk main.tex` fails and looks like LaTeX isn't installed.

## Rule

**LaTeX is installed via TinyTeX at `~/Library/TinyTeX/bin/universal-darwin/`.
Prepend it to PATH before compiling.**

```bash
cd college/mydeliverables/1st-Review/report
export PATH="$HOME/Library/TinyTeX/bin/universal-darwin:$PATH"
latexmk -pdf -interaction=nonstopmode -halt-on-error main.tex
```

- TeX Live 2026, `latexmk` 4.88, pdfTeX engine.
- `latexmk` runs the needed multiple passes itself — it resolves
  `\tableofcontents`, `\listoffigures`, `\listoftables`, cross-refs, and
  citations across passes. First-pass "undefined citation/reference" warnings
  are expected and clear on rerun; check the **final** `main.log` (`grep -c
  undefined main.log` should be `0`), not `build.log`.
- Clean build: `latexmk -C main.tex` (removes all generated artifacts).

## Citations

Bibliography is a **hand-maintained `thebibliography` block** inside
`main.tex` — there is **no `.bib` file and no BibTeX/biber step**. To add a
reference: add a `\bibitem{key}` to the bibliography and `\cite{key}` inline.
Cite-key convention is `lastnameYEAR` (e.g. `islam2024`, `saqr2026`).

## The `.venv` is NOT for LaTeX

`study-planner-web/.venv` (Python 3.14) is for the literature-evaluation
scripts under `college/mydeliverables/zero/literatures/` (packages: `pypdf`,
`pygments`, `pip`). It plays **no role** in the TeX build. `main.tex` does not
use `minted`, so `pygmentize` is irrelevant to compilation. Keep the two
concerns separate.

## Packages used

Standard only — `inputenc`, `fontenc`, `graphicx`, `booktabs`, `array`,
`enumitem`, `hyperref`, `geometry`. A4, 1-inch margins, `12pt`,
`secnumdepth=3` (numbers down to 2.1.1). No exotic dependencies.

## Generated artifacts

`.aux .fdb_latexmk .fls .lof .lot .out .toc .pdf .log` are build outputs.
`.gitignore` only excludes `*.log` — the rest would otherwise be tracked.

## When to Apply

- Compiling, editing, or maintaining `main.tex` (or any TeX file in this repo)
- When a `latexmk`/`pdflatex` "command not found" error appears
- When adding citations, figures, or new chapters to the report
